      "id": 1,
      "text": "In 1891, the Arkansas Supreme Court moved the county seat from Toledo to Rison after a spirited battle among the leading contenders.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
